# Whats on: Bassidi Kone Flights booked, locked and loaded!

[![Bassidi Kone](/media/2014/03/IMG_1998.jpg)](/media/2014/03/IMG_1998.jpg) Bassidi and his gorgeous fiance land here with us on June 26th for a fantastic and eventful 12 days of fun! With the Bassidi Kone World Music Tour in full planning, we are excited to announce many amazing events, workshops and performances across Byron Bay, Gold Coast, Brisbane and the Sunshine Coast! Be sure to subscribe to our newsletter to hear more information on date releases and private tuition availability.  It has been one year since Bassidi enjoyed the sunny coast with us and this time we have loads more events and opportunities for everyone to get involved. For more info on performances or if you have an event that you would like Bassidi to perform at email: info@rhythmculture.com.au
